        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing"/>
        <rdfs:comment>This is the fundamental main class that involves the capturing (or loading) of the data and the processing in the analysis unit (which leverages the SWRL rules). The DAU is a virtual entity that is used to connect the data with the processing and back to the label. The sensor is a class to represent the different types of sensors that can be used.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Class>
    


